# ::tok This turns off certain keywords in GNU Cc that are not ANSI Cc-compatible features, as well as ANSI trigraph features such as unix and vax, which are welcome and rarely used, and the main function, which returns an int value, even though it is disabled for use in all the standard libraries available in the hosted environment. Typical examples are almost all programs except the kernel. The corresponding f£reestanding environment has no standard libraries, and the entry point to a program is not necessarily main, the most obvious example being the operating system kernel. (For more information, see the recent information on the gcc website).
