# ::tok Personal pension savings have the characteristics of longer term, higher interest rate and high security, which are suitable for people with weak risk-tolerance ability; personal pension insurance products emphasize on protection, which are more suitable for people who can't bear the investment risk and can accept the stable income; and personal pension financial products and public fund products don't guarantee the capital or the income, which have a certain investment risk, but the expected income is higher, which is suitable for people who have a certain degree of financial knowledge and higher risk-tolerance ability. They have certain investment risks but higher expected returns, and are suitable for people with certain financial knowledge and higher risk-bearing ability.
