# ::tok According to the survey, 58% of the international students who decided to go back to China believe that "life in China is more convenient", 40% decided to go back to China because they "identify more with the cultural environment in China", and 32% believe that "there are more job opportunities in China". 32% believe that "there are more job opportunities in China" and 22% believe that economic activities in China will recover faster and more job opportunities will be available.
