# ::tok In order to handle the relationship between keeping the right and innovation well, it is necessary not only to keep the origin, root and soul of Chinese-style modernization, and unswervingly adhere to the Chinese characteristics, essential requirements and major principles of Chinese-style modernization, so as to ensure that Chinese-style modernization is in the right direction, but also to place innovation in a prominent position in the overall situation of the country's development, conform to the requirements of the times, focus on solving major theoretical and practical problems, actively recognize and respond to changes, and vigorously promote reform and innovation, and constantly shape new dynamics and new advantages for development to fully stimulate the creative vitality of the whole society. We should promote reform and innovation, continuously shape new momentum and new advantages for development, and fully stimulate the creative energies of society as a whole.
