# ::tok This large-scale delegation of 100 Hong Kong people, including the heads of tourism-related departments of the Hong Kong Government, more than 60 representatives from travel agencies and cross-border transportation operators in Hong Kong and Macao, as well as about 30 journalists from travel magazines and newspapers, representatives from travel social media, online media, and bloggers/web celebrities, etc., came to Macao for exchange and inspection, to learn about Macao's latest tourism resources, and for Hong Kong's travel trade and media to bring Macao tourism's new ways of play to Hong Kong residents and visitors. The Hong Kong trade and media brought new ways of Macau tourism to Hong Kong residents and tourists visiting Hong Kong, taking advantage of Hong Kong's transportation hub to expand the market of Hong Kong-Macau "joint tours".
