# ::tok Cai Qi said that the study and implementation of Xi Jinping's thought of socialism with Chinese characteristics for a new era and the spirit of the 20th Party Congress is not only the primary political task of the current and future period, but also a long-term strategic task, in accordance with the requirements of "comprehensive study, comprehensive grasp, comprehensive implementation", to promote the study and implementation of work constantly deeper and deeper, to the real, and to the heart. We should follow the requirement of "comprehensive study, comprehensive grasp, and comprehensive implementation" to promote the study and implementation work to go deeper and deeper, to go more practical, and to go to the heart.
